    given-names: "Irtiqa"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-18
url: "https://github.com/IrtiqaHaider/sawyer-rlhf"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IrtiqaHaider/sawyer-rlhf"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >
  Complete code, configuration files, evaluation data, and analysis artifacts 
  for a controlled low-resource classical RLHF experiment (SFT → Reward Model → PPO) 
  on GPT-2 (124M) under single-GPU constraints. This release accompanies the 
  September 2026 manuscript revision and documents a new experiment; it does not 
  reconstruct earlier superseded runs.
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning-from-human-feedback
  - RLHF
  - GPT-2
  - reward-over-optimization
  - reproducibility
